# Database migrations (Alembic)

The application creates missing tables automatically at start-up (`Base.metadata.create_all`).
These Alembic migrations exist for controlled schema upgrades, e.g. when moving to PostgreSQL:

```bash
cd backend
../.venv/bin/alembic upgrade head          # apply
../.venv/bin/alembic revision --autogenerate -m "describe change"
```

The URL is taken from `SMIT_DATABASE_URL` (or `SMIT_DATA_DIR`).
